{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1543123-pantheons-relations-map","id":1543123,"title":"Pantheons relations map?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-04T15:09:44-07:00","id":1543123,"title":"Pantheons relations map?","content":"I've been trying to wrap my head around the web of relations between the Pantheons. Just with the vanilla 10 from Hero, it's a headache. How about we come together to create a visual map with lines and colors as quich reference guide?<br /> <br /> I'll list the relations that are outright stated or that I read as implied, starting with Origin and Hero, in no particular order<br /> <br /> &lt;3 means good relations, ~= means neutral, X means bad. In case there's ambiguity, I choose off of my surface impression<br /> <br /> Hardline Pro-Titanomachists:<br /> Theoi - Deva - Teotl<br /> <br /> Hardline Anti-Titanomachists:<br /> Orisha/Loa - Manitou<br /> <br /> Deva &lt;3 Shen<br /> Deva &lt;3 Kami<br /> Deva &lt;3 Teotl<br /> Deva &lt;3 Palas<br /> Palas &lt;3 Kami<br /> Aesir &lt;3 Tuatha<br /> Tuatha &lt;3 Kami<br /> Kami &lt;3 Christian (one line in the Kami relations section mentions a link between Kannon and Virgin Mary, apparently, even if it comes a bit out of nowhere without context)<br /> Manitou &lt;3 Orisha/Loa<br /> Manitou &lt;3 Kami<br /> Orisha/Loa &lt;3 Kami<br /> Theoi &lt;3 Netjer<br /> Netjer &lt;3 Teotl<br /> Christian &lt;3 Tuatha (Catholic Churches in Boston serve double duty as Tuatha groves, and many Bostonians practice both faiths)<br /> Christian &lt;3 Theoi (similar as previous, Origin mentions the Pantheon building in Rome serving as both a Catholic church and a temple to other Gods, presumably Theoi)<br /> Orisha/Loa &lt;3 Shen<br /> Teotl &lt;3 Apu<br /> Teotl &lt;3 K'uh<br /> Aesir &lt;3 Teotl<br /> <br /> <br /> Aesir ~= Netjer<br /> Manitou ~= Tuatha<br /> Manitou ~= Aesir<br /> Orisha/Loa ~= Yazata<br /> Orisha/Loa ~= Netjer<br /> Teotl ~= Manitou (Teotl likes the Manitou but it's not reciprocated)<br /> <br /> Theoi X Tuatha<br /> Deva X Yazata<br /> Theoi X Deva<br /> Aesir X Deva<br /> Deva X Orisha/Loa<br /> Teotl X Orisha/Loa<br /> Teotl X Deva<br /> Teotl X Theoi<br /> <br /> WIP, will edit with my own continued research and the proposals from the comments","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28221,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","user":"ChronoRebel","date":". 10-05-2024, 01:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28221-chronorebel","name":"ChronoRebel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}